# 📊 Advanced Linux Log Analysis & File Search

## Objective

Log analysis is an essential DevOps skill used to troubleshoot applications, monitor servers, and identify security issues. In this task, you'll find the most common log messages, search for recently modified files, and create a shell script to filter `ERROR` and `WARNING` log entries.

